        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## The Mode\n",
        "\n",
        "The **mode** is the most frequently occurring value.\n",
        "\n",
        "The mode is especially useful for categorical variables.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Example: Chest Pain Type"
      ],
      "id": "caf2fdb5"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "mode_cp = df[\"cp\"].mode()[0]\n",
        "print(f\"Mode of chest pain type = {int(mode_cp)}\")"
      ],
